into this question of how deaf people walk inside. He told me about his latest experiment. So I'm doing a comparative study between people who are speaking, walking along H Street. I think that doesn't sound like a Robert. Yeah, that's actually the voice of Carolyn Restler. She's an interpreter at Gallaudet. Carry on that.

